# Keep the build context small. (Build context is the repository root — see
# docker-compose.yml.) The monitor image copies monitor/, engine/, store.py,
# modbus_codec.py and config.yaml; the dashboard image copies dashboard/ and
# config.yaml; the tests image copies tests/, engine/ and config.yaml; the Phase 2
# goose image (decoy IED + GOOSE traffic monitor) copies goose/, store.py and
# config.yaml; the honeypot ingester image copies honeypot/, store.py, modbus_codec.py
# and config.yaml; the legitimate PLC simulator image copies plc/ and config.yaml.
# Everything else is left out until a service needs it.
#
# store.py and modbus_codec.py are at the repository root rather than inside monitor/
# because more than one image needs the same raw_events schema and the same Modbus
# decoder, and both must not be excluded here.
.git
.gitignore
.freebuff
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
data/
docs/
# honeypot/ is deliberately NOT excluded: the honeypot ingester image builds from this
# context (honeypot/log_ingest.py). The Conpot decoy itself runs the upstream image and
# never builds from here.
# goose/ is deliberately NOT excluded: the goose image builds from this context.
README*.md
CLAUDE.md
# tests/ is deliberately NOT excluded: the tests image builds from this context.
